<title>USA: Lasertechnics wins ID card order in China.</title>
<headline>Lasertechnics wins ID card order in China.</headline>
<dateline>CARROLLTON, Texas 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lasertechnics Inc said Thursday that its Sandia Imaging Systems unit will supply the China with an additional $2 million of digital card printers and supplies.</p>
<p>Lasertechnics said in a release that the deal is under a contract awarded to Coms-China Ltd, a subsidiary of Coms21 Ltd of Australia, for systems to produce fraud-resistant national identification cards.</p>
<p>The order is part of a larger contract awarded Coms-China that will enable China's national government to issue roughly 40 million ID cards over the next five years.</p>
</text>
